From 756a9034821f0e025fa38c6339d56866861bcf63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thang <thang@local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 05:11:33 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Gamuroid C2: report the console's online state through C
 exports

New exports gamuroid_net_state_get() and gamuroid_net_state_listen(fn).
Once per retro_run the core reads the emulated access point's client
state (engine accessor) and calls the listener only when the code
changes (0 none, 1 authenticated, 2 associated). Each load starts at 0;
unload reports 0 if the session ended online and then stays quiet;
deinit forgets the listener. No core option and no SET_VARIABLE side
channel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
